*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Ryoga Hibiki (Enemy)|Ryoga Hibiki]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*4 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[Ranma Saotome (M) (Enemy)|Ranma Saotome (M)]] spawns as the boss after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*2 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 0.67~1 seconds<sup>20f~30f</sup>.
*2 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 0.67~1 seconds<sup>20f~30f</sup>.
*2 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 106.67 seconds<sup>3,200f</sup>, delay 0.67~1 seconds<sup>20f~30f</sup>.

